<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>404 - Halaman Tidak Ditemukan - SaaS API</title>
  <link href="/css/base.css" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    nav { margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; }
    nav a { margin-right: 16px; text-decoration: none; color: #333;
            font-weight: bold; font-family: monospace; }
    nav a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    .notfound { max-width: 500px; margin: 60px auto; text-align: center;
                font-family: monospace; }
    .notfound h1 { font-size: 72px; margin: 0; }
    .notfound p  { color: #666; }
    .notfound .back {
      display: inline-block; margin-top: 16px; padding: 10px 20px;
      background: white; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 8px;
      color: #333; text-decoration: none; font-family: monospace;
    }
    .notfound .back:hover { background: #f0f0f0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav>
    <a href="/">Home</a>
    <a href="/auth">Auth</a>
    <a href="/todo">Todo List</a>
    <a href="/dsa">DSA</a>
  </nav>

  <div class="notfound">
    <h1>404</h1>
    <p>Halaman tidak ditemukan.</p>
    <p>URL yang Anda tuju tidak tersedia — mungkin salah ketik atau sudah dipindah.</p>
    <a href="/" class="back">&larr; Kembali ke Home</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>